        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ludwig van Beethoven\n- Works: Cello Sonata No. 3 in A major, Op. 69; Fifth Symphony; Sixth Symphony\n- Places: Theater an der Wien\n- Events: 22 December 1808 concert\n\nFacts:\n- In 1808, Ludwig van Beethoven wrote Cello Sonata No. 3 in A major, Op. 69.\n- In 1808, Ludwig van Beethoven composed, completed, and published his Fifth Symphony and Sixth Symphony.\n- On 22 December 1808, Ludwig van Beethoven’s Fifth Symphony and Sixth Symphony were first performed at the Theater an der Wien.\n- The 22 December 1808 performance took place during a four-hour concert.",
